1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:03,281
One coffee. Keep the change.

2
00:00:03,321 --> 00:00:05,070
We don't take stars.

3
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:07,207
It's a small one.

4
00:00:07,577 --> 00:00:11,596
It's so warm! Rae,
it's like holding a puppy!

5
00:00:11,636 --> 00:00:14,752
Pip. Your hair is on fire.

6
00:00:14,922 --> 00:00:16,523
Only a little!

7
00:00:16,593 --> 00:00:21,259
Reminder: all currency must be
cooler than the store.

8
00:00:21,299 --> 00:00:24,520
Fine. I'll pay with a moon.

9
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:28,509
Ooh! Can we keep it?

10
00:00:28,549 --> 00:00:29,915
No.

11
00:00:30,285 --> 00:00:33,151
Do you have anything... normal?

12
00:00:33,191 --> 00:00:34,657
A coupon?

13
00:00:34,697 --> 00:00:36,204
Expired.

14
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:38,456
You didn't even look at it.

15
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:40,985
Everything here is expired.
